{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:17-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["es"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Por favor, utilice la tecla de retroceso para borrar."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Las teclas de flecha izquierda, arriba y abajo est\u00e1n desactivadas. Tambi\u00e9n lo est\u00e1n las teclas de inicio, fin, pgup y pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Utilice la tecla de retroceso para borrar."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Si el valor est\u00e1 seleccionado, s\u00f3lo tiene que empezar a escribir el nuevo valor para borrar el valor anterior."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Cuando se selecciona un n\u00famero (el valor se muestra en sentido inverso), utilice la tecla de flecha derecha para borrar la selecci\u00f3n sin borrar el valor. A continuaci\u00f3n, retroceda para editar."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["CONSEJO: En general, es mejor utilizar las teclas TAB o SHIFT-TAB para pasar de una entrada a la siguiente o a la anterior."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["SUGERENCIA 2: En general, la edici\u00f3n de un valor es ineficiente. Dado que los valores se seleccionan autom\u00e1ticamente, basta con escribir el n\u00famero que desee."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["No escriba el car\u00e1cter separador de miles."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Si se usa la convenci\u00f3n de EE.UU., ser\u00eda la coma.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["\u00a1Soy lo suficientemente inteligente como para introducirlos por ti!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Se ha producido un error de c\u00e1lculo de fecha desconocido."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Por favor, facil\u00edtenos sus datos y configuraciones para que podamos solucionarlo. Gracias."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["La fecha no es v\u00e1lida - a\u00f1o incorrecto."],"Jan":["ene"],"Feb":["feb"],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Abr"],"May":["Mayo"],"Jun":["Jun"],"Jul":["Jul"],"Aug":["Ago"],"Sept":["Sept."],"Oct":["Oct"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["Dic."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Error: fechas fuera de secuencia."],"Exception":["Excepci\u00f3n"],"occurred when accessing":["se produjo al acceder a"],"Invalid index":["\u00cdndice no v\u00e1lido"],"Unknown":["Inc\u00f3gnita"],"u":["i"],"U":["I"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["L\u00edmite interno alcanzado. El saldo supera los +\/- 99 billones."],"YTD":["A\u00f1o a la fecha"],"Running Totals":["Totales acumulados"],"Normal":["Normal"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["Su calendario de pr\u00e9stamos personalizado"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["El importe del \u00faltimo pago ha disminuido en"],"due to rounding":["debido al redondeo"],"Last payment amount increased by":["El importe del \u00faltimo pago se increment\u00f3 en"],"Loan Summary":["Resumen del pr\u00e9stamo"],"Loan Amount":["Importe del pr\u00e9stamo"],"Number of Payments":["N\u00famero de pagos"],"Annual Interest Rate":["Tasa de inter\u00e9s anual"],"Periodic Payment":["Pago peri\u00f3dico"],"Loan Date":["Fecha del pr\u00e9stamo"],"1st Payment Due":["Primer pago a vencer"],"Payment Frequency":["Frecuencia de pago"],"Last Payment Due":["\u00daltimo pago a vencer"],"Total Interest Due":["Total de intereses adeudados"],"Total All Payments":["Total de todos los pagos"],"Payment Schedule":["Calendario de pagos"],"Year":["A\u00f1o"],"Date":["Fecha"],"Payment":["Pago"],"Interest":["Inter\u00e9s"],"Principal":["Capital"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Calculation method: Normal":["M\u00e9todo de c\u00e1lculo: Normal"],"Total Principal":["Capital total"],"Total Interest":["Total de intereses"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["Porc. del total de pagos"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["Totales anuales de capital e intereses"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Capital e intereses acumulados con saldo restante"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Total de capital e intereses"],"Loan":["Pr\u00e9stamo"],"There are too many unknown values.":["Hay demasiados valores desconocidos."],"Enter \"Loan Amount\", \"Number of Payments\" and \"Annual Interest Rate\".":["Introduzca el \"Importe del pr\u00e9stamo\", el \"N\u00famero de pagos\" y la \"Tasa de inter\u00e9s anual\"."],"<strong>Loan Calculator Help...<\/strong>":["<strong>Ayuda de la calculadora de pr\u00e9stamos...<\/strong>"],"<p>Using the calculator is straightforward. User enters a &quot;loan amount&quot;, &quot;number of months&quot;, &quot;annual interest rate&quot;. The calculator calculates the monthly payment amount.<\/p>":["<p>Usar la calculadora es sencillo. El usuario ingresa un &quot;importe del pr\u00e9stamo&quot;, &quot;n\u00famero de meses&quot;, &quot;tasa de inter\u00e9s anual&quot;. La calculadora calcula el importe del pago mensual.<\/p>"],"<p>The &quot;Payment Method&quot; determines when the first payment is due. With the default selection, &quot;End-of-Period&quot;, the first payment will be due one month after the loan is made. If &quot;Start-of-Period&quot; is selected, then the first payment will be due on the loan date.<\/p>":["<p>El \"momento del pago\" determina cu\u00e1ndo vence el primer pago. Con la selecci\u00f3n predeterminada, \"Fin de Per\u00edodo\", el primer pago vencer\u00e1 un mes despu\u00e9s de que se realice el pr\u00e9stamo. Si se selecciona \"Inicio de Per\u00edodo\", entonces el primer pago vencer\u00e1 en la fecha del pr\u00e9stamo.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">El plazo (duraci\u00f3n) del pr\u00e9stamo se expresa como un n\u00famero de meses.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 meses = &nbsp;5 a\u00f1os<\/li><li>120 meses = 10 a\u00f1os<\/li><li>180 meses = 15 a\u00f1os<\/li><li>240 meses = 20 a\u00f1os<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 meses = 30 a\u00f1os<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the schedule? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">\u00bfNecesita m\u00e1s opciones, incluida la capacidad de resolver otras inc\u00f3gnitas? \u00bfEstablecer las fechas? \u00bfEstablecer o cambiar la frecuencia de los pagos y la capitalizaci\u00f3n? \u00bfImprimir la tabla de amortizaci\u00f3n? \u00bfExportar a archivos de MS Word&trade; (.docx) o MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx)? Por favor visite, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Las fechas deben ser el primer d\u00eda del mes."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Un objeto de fecha de JavaScript no v\u00e1lido."],"Monthly":["Mensual"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the charts? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">\u00bfNecesita m\u00e1s opciones, incluida la capacidad de resolver otras inc\u00f3gnitas? \u00bfEstablecer las fechas? \u00bfEstablecer o cambiar la frecuencia de los pagos y la capitalizaci\u00f3n? \u00bfImprimir los gr\u00e1ficos? \u00bfExportar a archivos de MS Word&trade; (.docx) o MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx)? Por favor visite, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Preparado para"],"Address":["Direcci\u00f3n"],"City, State  ZIP":["Ciudad, Estado  C\u00f3digo Postal"],"Prepared On":["Preparado el"],"Prepared by":["Preparado por"],"Phone":["Tel\u00e9fono"],"Email":["Correo electr\u00f3nico"],"Website":["Sitio web"]}}}